      "writtenOn": "2022-06-09T13:05:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is MUST for us. Following is the case.\nIn Android as Guest case, Device tree update for firmware node is not done by Hypervisor.\n\nWe need to set the status as disabled for android, vendor node. for this purpose, we need this function to be exported.\n\nPlease let us know if any concerns.",
